What this licence covers
------------------------

The MIT licence above covers DEFECTOR's own work: its code, data and
documentation, and the project-owned content made for it (the AI-generated
comms portraits, logo and app icons, the Flagship hull, and the
generated comms cues and Maul alarm), all marked "Project-owned" in
game/assets/CREDITS.md.

Third-party content keeps its own licence:

- Third-party art, sound effects, music and the font under game/assets/ are
  all CC0 1.0. Each file, its source and its licence are listed in
  game/assets/CREDITS.md.
- game/addons/gut/ is GUT (Godot Unit Test), under its own MIT licence in
  game/addons/gut/LICENSE.md; its bundled fonts are under the SIL Open Font
  Licence (game/addons/gut/fonts/OFL.txt). GUT is used for testing only and
  is not part of the game build.
- The BMAD tooling in _bmad/, .agents/ and .claude/skills/ comes from the
  BMAD Method and its modules (listed with their upstream repositories in
  _bmad/_config/manifest.yaml) and stays under the licences of those
  projects.
- The game is built with the Godot Engine (MIT licence). The release zips'
  CREDITS.txt carries the engine's licence and the notices of the
  third-party code compiled into it.
